<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">owareru youni</font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Running like a fugitive,</font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:22,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">isoi de iru</font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:22,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">being chased by something.</font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">kawai ta mune ga</font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Inside my heart is pounding,</font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">kari tateru no sa</font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">my throat dry like it's withering.</font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">dare no tame de naku</font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">For no single one,</font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">dare no mono de naku</font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">to none does belong,</font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">ore tachi no ima ga</font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">this time is ours, right now...</font></b></font></font>

19
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">itami hodoki kokoro hodoki kage o hodoki</font></b></font></font>

20
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Unraveling the pain, unraveling our hearts, unraveling shadows.</font></b></font></font>

21
00:00:55,100 --> 00:01:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">iki o tsunete hashiri nukero yami o saite</font></b></font></font>

22
00:00:55,100 --> 00:01:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Stifling our breath, reaching for beyond, tearing through the dark.</font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:03,230 --> 00:01:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">tatakau koto mo aishi au koto mo</font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:03,230 --> 00:01:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">In fighting and in love.</font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:11,010 --> 00:01:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">owari wa shinai</font></b></font></font>

26
00:01:11,010 --> 00:01:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:28,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:28,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:37,610 --> 00:01:40,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems I've overused
my Sharingan...</font>

32
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:43,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you alright, Sensei?</font>

33
00:01:44,370 --> 00:01:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not really... It will be hard just to
move for about a week...</font>

34
00:01:49,250 --> 00:01:50,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

35
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:52,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would be better if
you didn't move for a while.</font>

36
00:01:53,170 --> 00:01:54,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">O-Okay...</font>

37
00:01:58,470 --> 00:02:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Sensei's awake.</font>

38
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:02,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on!</font>

39
00:02:03,010 --> 00:02:04,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your Sharingan is fantastic,</font>

40
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:08,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but if it puts that much of a strain
on your body, it may not be worth it!</font>

41
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sorry...</font>

42
00:02:10,190 --> 00:02:11,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you know...</font>

43
00:02:11,650 --> 00:02:14,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He did take down
a real powerful Ninja like that!</font>

44
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:16,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We probably don't need to
worry for a while.</font>

45
00:02:16,650 --> 00:02:20,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, that kid with the mask...
What was he?</font>

46
00:02:21,700 --> 00:02:23,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was an ANBU black ops
from the Hidden Mist village.</font>

47
00:02:24,740 --> 00:02:27,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a mask that the elite
Ninja Tracking Unit wears.</font>

48
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The elite Ninja Tracking Unit?</font>

49
00:02:29,710 --> 00:02:32,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're commonly called the
"fire extinguishing corps,"</font>

50
00:02:33,130 --> 00:02:36,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and their duty is to erase all traces
that a Ninja ever lived.</font>

51
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:39,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The body of the Ninja reveals
a variety of things...</font>

52
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninjutsu secrets and Chakra characteristics
which permeate the Shinobi of their village...</font>

53
00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the composition of secret medicines
used on a Ninja's body...</font>

54
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For instance, if I were to die,</font>

55
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:56,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">every secret about my Sharingan
would be investigated thoroughly,</font>

56
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:58,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and in the worst case,</font>

57
00:02:58,780 --> 00:03:01,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's a danger that
my entire Jutsu could be stolen.</font>

58
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:04,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
Tracker Ninja are specialists</font>

59
00:03:04,370 --> 00:03:07,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that prevent village secrets
from leaking out</font>

60
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:10,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by killing Rogue Ninja
who've run away from their village,</font>

61
00:03:10,830 --> 00:03:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and completely eliminating
their bodies.</font>

62
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:21,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, I'll cut the mouth cloth
and have him spit up blood...</font>

63
00:03:24,050 --> 00:03:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's alright.</font>

64
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:27,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it... myself...</font>

65
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:31,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?
You've already come back to life...</font>

66
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, you really are rough...</font>

67
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You too, Zabuza-san.</font>

68
00:03:42,570 --> 00:03:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't pull them out
so violently or you really will die.</font>

69
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:54,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How long do you plan on keeping
that shady-looking mask on?!</font>

70
00:03:54,670 --> 00:03:55,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take it off!</font>

71
00:03:56,290 --> 00:04:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a relic from the past,
and it's been handy for trickery...</font>

72
00:04:05,510 --> 00:04:10,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if I hadn't rescued you,
you certainly would have been killed.</font>

73
00:04:10,890 --> 00:04:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you were going to put me
into a state of apparent death,</font>

74
00:04:12,850 --> 00:04:15,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you didn't need to aim for
the secret opening on my neck.</font>

75
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:19,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're really a nasty one.</font>

76
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It couldn't be helped...</font>

77
00:04:22,950 --> 00:04:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, I didn't want to mark up
your immaculate body.</font>

78
00:04:27,990 --> 00:04:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also, I can aim more accurately
on the point on the neck</font>

79
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:33,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where there's not much muscle.</font>

80
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:39,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be numb for about a week
and won't be able to move.</font>

81
00:04:40,050 --> 00:04:44,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But since you're Zabuza-san,
perhaps you'll soon be able to move...</font>

82
00:04:48,050 --> 00:04:52,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're so innocent, smart,
and untainted...</font>

83
00:04:52,930 --> 00:04:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I like about you.</font>

84
00:04:57,020 --> 00:04:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am, after all, still a child.</font>

85
00:05:02,110 --> 00:05:03,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fog has lifted.</font>

86
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:04,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

87
00:05:06,530 --> 00:05:08,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will you be alright the next time?</font>

88
00:05:09,950 --> 00:05:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The next time...</font>

89
00:05:11,870 --> 00:05:13,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be able to see right
through the Sharingan.</font>

90
00:05:14,410 --> 00:05:20,430
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Forest of Chakra</font>

91
00:05:22,510 --> 00:05:23,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?</font>

92
00:05:24,050 --> 00:05:25,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though Zabuza is dead...</font>

93
00:05:25,970 --> 00:05:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this indescribable uneasiness...</font>

94
00:05:28,930 --> 00:05:30,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it must mean something
very important...</font>

95
00:05:31,970 --> 00:05:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a feeling
I've overlooked something.</font>

96
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?!
Sensei?</font>

97
00:05:38,230 --> 00:05:38,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

98
00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:41,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... so to continue my earlier story...</font>

99
00:05:42,860 --> 00:05:43,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja trackers...</font>

100
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:47,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">take care of the bodies of people they've
killed, immediately and on the spot.</font>

101
00:05:47,990 --> 00:05:49,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what about that?</font>

102
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:54,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did that kid with
the mask do with Zabuza?</font>

103
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How should we know?!</font>

104
00:05:58,790 --> 00:06:01,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That masked one
took Zabuza away!</font>

105
00:06:02,670 --> 00:06:03,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

106
00:06:04,670 --> 00:06:08,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he needed proof he'd killed Zabuza,
he could simply have taken the head...</font>

107
00:06:09,930 --> 00:06:11,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the question is...</font>

108
00:06:11,100 --> 00:06:15,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the weapon the Ninja tracker kid
used to kill Zabuza...</font>

109
00:06:16,810 --> 00:06:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A regular Senbon...</font>

110
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:19,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's impossible...</font>

111
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:22,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right... it's impossible?!</font>

112
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What have you guys
been clamoring on and on about?!</font>

113
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:31,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably that...
Zabuza is alive!</font>

114
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:35,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

115
00:06:35,450 --> 00:06:37,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell do you mean?!</font>

116
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:41,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Kakashi-sensei,
you made sure that he was dead!</font>

117
00:06:41,580 --> 00:06:43,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true, I did make sure...</font>

118
00:06:44,250 --> 00:06:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, he was probably just in
a state of near-death.</font>

119
00:06:52,850 --> 00:06:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Senbon that Tracker Ninja used has
a very low ability to kill</font>

120
00:06:57,730 --> 00:07:00,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">unless it hits a vital spot...</font>

121
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:03,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's something that was originally used
for medical treatments</font>

122
00:07:03,610 --> 00:07:05,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">such as acupuncture therapy.</font>

123
00:07:06,110 --> 00:07:09,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja trackers know all about
the structure of the human body...</font>

124
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:14,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">putting people into a state of apparent
near-death is probably simple for them.</font>

125
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:18,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, he went to the trouble of
taking Zabuza's corpse</font>

126
00:07:18,830 --> 00:07:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which was probably heavier
than he is.</font>

127
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:26,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Second, he used a Senbon,
a weapon with a low ability to kill.</font>

128
00:07:28,050 --> 00:07:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From these two factors,</font>

129
00:07:29,380 --> 00:07:34,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that youth wasn't aiming to
kill Zabuza but to save him.</font>

130
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't you reading
way too much into it?</font>

131
00:07:38,270 --> 00:07:38,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

132
00:07:39,350 --> 00:07:43,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If something seems fishy,
make preparations before it's too late.</font>

133
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's also an iron clad rule
of the Shinobi!</font>

134
00:07:51,780 --> 00:07:56,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... To hear that Zabuza
may be alive and to be pleased...</font>

135
00:07:57,240 --> 00:08:00,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei, what do we do to make preparations
before it's too late?</font>

136
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't even be able
to move for a while...</font>

137
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:08,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll assign you training!</font>

138
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:13,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait a minute! Even with training,
we're not gonna be that strong!</font>

139
00:08:14,180 --> 00:08:18,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our opponent is a Ninja whom even you,
with the Sharingan, had a tough fight with!</font>

140
00:08:18,970 --> 00:08:21,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you trying to kill us?!</font>

141
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

142
00:08:23,730 --> 00:08:26,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who was it that saved me
during my difficult battle?</font>

143
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:31,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've all quickly grown...
especially Naruto!</font>

144
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:34,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've grown the most!</font>

145
00:08:38,870 --> 00:08:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He clearly does seem somewhat
stronger than before, but...</font>

146
00:08:43,370 --> 00:08:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you noticed, Kakashi-sensei!
Now it's getting interesting!</font>

147
00:08:48,540 --> 00:08:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not interesting at all...</font>

148
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the heck are you?</font>

149
00:08:57,970 --> 00:09:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Inari!
Where've you been?!</font>

150
00:09:00,510 --> 00:09:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome back... Grandpa...</font>

151
00:09:02,890 --> 00:09:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari, what sort of greeting is that?!</font>

152
00:09:05,230 --> 00:09:08,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are the Ninja
who escorted your grandpa!</font>

153
00:09:08,770 --> 00:09:11,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay, it's okay.
Right, Inari?</font>

154
00:09:17,780 --> 00:09:19,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom, these guys will die...</font>

155
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way they can
oppose Gato and win.</font>

156
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:25,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what, you little brat!</font>

157
00:09:25,370 --> 00:09:27,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now listen up!</font>

158
00:09:27,290 --> 00:09:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a super hero who's gonna become
an awesome Ninja</font>

159
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">named Hokage in the future!</font>

160
00:09:31,340 --> 00:09:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know if it's Gato or
Chocolate or whatever...</font>

161
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:36,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not worried
about those guys, at all!</font>

162
00:09:36,590 --> 00:09:41,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, a hero. That's ridiculous!
There's no such thing!</font>

163
00:09:41,850 --> 00:09:43,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What did you say?!</font>

164
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:45,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop that!</font>

165
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't want to die,
you'd better hurry up and go home...</font>

166
00:09:52,650 --> 00:09:54,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari, where're you going?</font>

167
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:58,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sea...
I'll be looking at the sea...</font>

168
00:10:03,540 --> 00:10:04,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I apologize.</font>

169
00:10:08,170 --> 00:10:09,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

170
00:10:09,790 --> 00:10:13,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That brat... I need to tell him
a thing or two!</font>

171
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:19,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

172
00:10:21,350 --> 00:10:22,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he crying?!</font>

173
00:10:35,780 --> 00:10:37,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Dad...</font>

174
00:10:48,870 --> 00:10:51,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, now the training begins!</font>

175
00:10:51,830 --> 00:10:52,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

176
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... before that, let me again explain
Chakra power for a Ninja, from the basics.</font>

177
00:11:00,090 --> 00:11:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this point...</font>

178
00:11:01,470 --> 00:11:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course we know about that!
Chatora, right?</font>

179
00:11:05,890 --> 00:11:06,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Chakra...</font>

180
00:11:07,890 --> 00:11:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, Sakura-kun...?</font>

181
00:11:09,850 --> 00:11:11,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you listening, Naruto?!</font>

182
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's tiresome, so I'll explain it simply!</font>

183
00:11:16,030 --> 00:11:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra is energy that
a Ninja needs when he uses a Jutsu!</font>

184
00:11:21,950 --> 00:11:23,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's made up of two energies:</font>

185
00:11:23,780 --> 00:11:28,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">1) Physical energy gathered together
from each and every cell in the body and</font>

186
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">2) Spiritual energy accumulated based
on numerous trainings and experiences!</font>

187
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:40,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, Jutsu wrings out and
combines these two energies</font>

188
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:41,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from within the body,</font>

189
00:11:41,590 --> 00:11:44,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and this is called
"combining the Chakra."</font>

190
00:11:45,010 --> 00:11:50,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then Chakra is activated
by forming hand "signs."</font>

191
00:11:51,310 --> 00:11:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's exactly right!</font>

192
00:11:52,690 --> 00:11:56,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei really does
have good students.</font>

193
00:11:57,610 --> 00:12:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever! I may not understand
difficult explanations,</font>

194
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I'll just learn it with my body!</font>

195
00:12:03,990 --> 00:12:05,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto is absolutely right...</font>

196
00:12:05,910 --> 00:12:08,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're already able to use Jutsu...</font>

197
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:12,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! All of you still haven't used
Chakra efficiently.</font>

198
00:12:13,210 --> 00:12:13,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

199
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold on and listen...</font>

200
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:18,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As Sakura explained earlier,</font>

201
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:23,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">combining Chakra means picking up
both the physical and spiritual energies</font>

202
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and mixing them together
within the body.</font>

203
00:12:27,430 --> 00:12:32,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And of course the amount of each energy,
the preparation of the energy,</font>

204
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:35,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">changes based on
the Jutsu you want to activate...</font>

205
00:12:35,770 --> 00:12:39,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of you at present aren't
using Chakra efficiently!</font>

206
00:12:40,190 --> 00:12:43,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you're able to combine
a lot of Chakra,</font>

207
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:46,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you're not able to control it
in a balanced way</font>

208
00:12:46,820 --> 00:12:49,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the effectiveness of the Jutsu
not only will be cut in half</font>

209
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it may not even
be activated at all.</font>

210
00:12:52,620 --> 00:12:56,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wasting energy will prevent you from
battling for long periods.</font>

211
00:12:56,380 --> 00:12:58,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are some of
the weaknesses that can occur.</font>

212
00:12:59,500 --> 00:13:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What should we do...?</font>

213
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:05,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You need to learn to control
the Chakra with your body!</font>

214
00:13:05,970 --> 00:13:10,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's difficult training that requires you
to put your life on the line to master!</font>

215
00:13:12,770 --> 00:13:14,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What will we do?</font>

216
00:13:15,270 --> 00:13:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?</font>

217
00:13:17,230 --> 00:13:17,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tree-climbing...</font>

218
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tree-climbing?!</font>

219
00:13:20,020 --> 00:13:20,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

220
00:13:21,110 --> 00:13:23,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's not just simple tree-climbing!</font>

221
00:13:23,820 --> 00:13:25,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will climb
without using your hands.</font>

222
00:13:25,900 --> 00:13:27,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? How?</font>

223
00:13:29,580 --> 00:13:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well! Just watch.</font>

224
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:48,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's climbing...</font>

225
00:13:49,550 --> 00:13:52,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perpendicular to the tree
and with his feet!</font>

226
00:13:55,390 --> 00:13:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So see, kind of like this...</font>

227
00:13:58,190 --> 00:14:01,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Focus the Chakra on the bottoms of your feet
and make them stick to the tree trunk.</font>

228
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you use Chakra well,
you can do things like this.</font>

229
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:06,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a minute!</font>

230
00:14:06,820 --> 00:14:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How does something like that
make you strong?</font>

231
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:11,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the main point...</font>

232
00:14:12,450 --> 00:14:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The aim of this training is
to accumulate</font>

233
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:18,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the required amount of combined Chakra
to the required spot...</font>

234
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is surprisingly difficult
even for an expert Ninja.</font>

235
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:26,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The amount of Chakra used
for tree-climbing is very subtle.</font>

236
00:14:27,260 --> 00:14:32,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the bottoms of the feet are
the most difficult place to gather Chakra.</font>

237
00:14:32,970 --> 00:14:36,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway! In other words,
if you master that control</font>

238
00:14:36,730 --> 00:14:41,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it will be possible to master
any Jutsu. In theory, that is!</font>

239
00:14:42,860 --> 00:14:46,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The second aim is to maintain
that combined Chakra.</font>

240
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:50,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja combine the most Chakra
during battles.</font>

241
00:14:50,990 --> 00:14:52,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Under such situations,</font>

242
00:14:52,450 --> 00:14:56,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"control" and "maintenance"
of Chakra becomes most difficult.</font>

243
00:14:57,120 --> 00:15:01,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So anyway, nothing's really gonna
happen with me saying this and that...</font>

244
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:05,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll need to learn it with your bodies</font>

245
00:15:09,220 --> 00:15:11,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Use that Kunai to put a mark
at the spot</font>

246
00:15:11,640 --> 00:15:14,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where you can climb up to
under your own strength now.</font>

247
00:15:16,060 --> 00:15:20,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next make an effort to
put a mark further from it.</font>

248
00:15:21,730 --> 00:15:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You aren't good enough to
walk up from the start,</font>

249
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:29,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so run and use your momentum
to get used to it... You got it?!</font>

250
00:15:31,860 --> 00:15:35,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This training is nothing!
Hah, it's too easy for me!</font>

251
00:15:36,870 --> 00:15:40,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, I'm the man
who's grown the most!</font>

252
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:44,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough with the talk...
Now get to it. Try climbing any tree.</font>

253
00:15:46,380 --> 00:15:50,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, so first I need to gather
the Chakra on the bottoms of my feet...</font>

254
00:15:58,270 --> 00:16:02,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ready!! Here I go!</font>

255
00:16:18,540 --> 00:16:22,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think it'd be this difficult to
maintain a constant amount of Chakra...</font>

256
00:16:22,330 --> 00:16:24,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the Chakra is too strong
you get pushed back...</font>

257
00:16:26,630 --> 00:16:31,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if the Chakra is too weak,
there's no sticking power and that happens.</font>

258
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...!</font>

259
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The difference between Naruto and Sasuke
seems about right.</font>

260
00:16:37,350 --> 00:16:38,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is pretty easy!</font>

261
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:40,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

262
00:16:41,430 --> 00:16:42,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sakura-chan!</font>

263
00:16:46,940 --> 00:16:53,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, it looks like the one with the best control
of the Chakra is Sakura, the girl...</font>

264
00:16:57,370 --> 00:16:59,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow! Way to go, Sakura-chan!</font>

265
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just what you'd expect from
the girl I set my sights on!</font>

266
00:17:01,700 --> 00:17:03,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it does sort of tick me off!</font>

267
00:17:04,290 --> 00:17:05,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever!</font>

268
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:07,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted Sasuke-kun to notice me...</font>

269
00:17:08,090 --> 00:17:10,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why does this always happen?!</font>

270
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, not only does Sakura have
knowledge about Chakra,</font>

271
00:17:13,550 --> 00:17:16,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">her control and stamina
are pretty good.</font>

272
00:17:16,970 --> 00:17:18,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like...</font>

273
00:17:18,350 --> 00:17:23,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She might be the closest one to
becoming a Hokage... unlike someone else.</font>

274
00:17:24,230 --> 00:17:28,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also, the Uchiha Clan
isn't really that great...</font>

275
00:17:28,650 --> 00:17:30,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, Sensei!</font>

276
00:17:31,530 --> 00:17:33,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun won't like me then!</font>

277
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:39,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having said that... Naruto and Sasuke...</font>

278
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two have an incredible amount
of Chakra hidden in them...</font>

279
00:17:43,500 --> 00:17:44,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that Sakura can't even match!</font>

280
00:17:45,370 --> 00:17:49,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this training goes well,
this will become an asset to them...</font>

281
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:53,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! First I'll catch up to Sasuke!</font>

282
00:17:53,420 --> 00:17:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it... for sure!</font>

283
00:18:00,350 --> 00:18:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever!</font>

284
00:18:02,470 --> 00:18:04,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if they do that,
it's just a waste...</font>

285
00:18:27,290 --> 00:18:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unbelievable...</font>

286
00:18:28,620 --> 00:18:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even you got beaten and
had to come back?</font>

287
00:18:30,750 --> 00:18:33,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Ninja from the Hidden Mist Village
look like total weaklings!</font>

288
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:35,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't even clean up after
your subordinates,</font>

289
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you think you're a "demon"!
Don't make me laugh!</font>

290
00:18:45,810 --> 00:18:46,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So they're drawing swords...</font>

291
00:18:49,230 --> 00:18:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold on. Wait.</font>

292
00:18:51,060 --> 00:18:54,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... There's no need to stay silent!</font>

293
00:18:55,030 --> 00:18:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you say something?</font>

294
00:19:01,660 --> 00:19:03,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't touch Zabuza-san
with your dirty hands!</font>

295
00:19:04,950 --> 00:19:06,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It's gonna break...!</font>

296
00:19:11,790 --> 00:19:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way...</font>

297
00:19:14,090 --> 00:19:15,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He moved... in an instant...</font>

298
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wouldn't do that...
I'm ticked off!!</font>

299
00:19:24,010 --> 00:19:24,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next time...</font>

300
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:27,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you lose again next time...</font>

301
00:19:27,140 --> 00:19:29,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">remember that there'll be
no place for you here!</font>

302
00:19:31,310 --> 00:19:32,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm leaving!</font>

303
00:19:36,860 --> 00:19:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku... Such unnecessary actions...</font>

304
00:19:40,150 --> 00:19:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...</font>

305
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's too early to take down
Gato right now...</font>

306
00:19:46,910 --> 00:19:48,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we make trouble here...</font>

307
00:19:51,290 --> 00:19:54,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be pursued by them again.</font>

308
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must restrain ourselves for now.</font>

309
00:19:59,010 --> 00:19:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

310
00:20:00,470 --> 00:20:01,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right.</font>

311
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:09,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow...</font>

312
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:12,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ou–ch!!</font>

313
00:20:21,820 --> 00:20:23,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm totally worn out!</font>

314
00:20:23,570 --> 00:20:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How much stamina
can those two have?</font>

315
00:20:32,120 --> 00:20:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Naruto isn't getting
any better at all.</font>

316
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll soon give up and
start throwing a tantrum.</font>

317
00:20:41,300 --> 00:20:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

318
00:20:42,130 --> 00:20:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See! He sure is
an easy one to figure out!</font>

319
00:20:47,050 --> 00:20:48,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sakura!</font>

320
00:20:49,060 --> 00:20:50,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you give me some tips?</font>

321
00:20:51,310 --> 00:20:52,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

322
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's keep it a secret from Sasuke!
Come on, come on.</font>

323
00:20:57,810 --> 00:21:02,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's getting stronger and stronger...
How strong will he get...?</font>

324
00:21:03,150 --> 00:21:04,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate Naruto...</font>

325
00:21:04,860 --> 00:21:09,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the amount of your dormant Chakra
is probably more than Sasuke's.</font>

326
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's even more than mine!</font>

327
00:21:15,210 --> 00:21:17,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I look forward to it... I really do.</font>

328
00:21:33,450 --> 00:21:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

329
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:40,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

